Description: Mission OS hardware driver management daemon
 mission-driverd manages hardware detection, driver discovery and inventory,
 driver matching and compatibility checking, driver install/update/remove
 operations, and driver signature verification.
 .
 This package contains the driver management daemon, D-Bus configuration,
 and PolKit policy files.
